        "claim": "For a legacy page (engram_id joined through import_map) the finding advises `promote --source memorycard --id M`. The README added in this same commit says `promote` refuses such a page as bridged until the vault is migrated. So for legacy pages the advice names a command that does not work, contradicting the commit's claim of a working command and the spec text that the advice names a command that works. The only tested working-command case is a native memorycard page.",
