        "claim": "The check now opens memorycard unconditionally. A vault with promoted pages but no memorycard database configured, or not yet migrated, previously got a real judgement from Engram. It now gets only an 'eligibility cannot be judged' warning, so frozen pages go unreported. This is a behavioural regression for users who have not adopted memorycard, though only advisory and without an exit-code effect.",
